   "fix": "Add `@[simp] theorem isGeneratingTriple_conjugate_smul_iff (\u03c4 : Perm (Fin n)) : (P.conjugate \u03c4).IsGeneratingTriple (\u03c4 \u2022 t) \u2194 P.IsGeneratingTriple t`, provable from `PermutationTriple.monodromyGroup_smul`, `Subgroup.map_injective` and `cycleData_smul` (CycleData.lean:88, which gives `cycleData (\u03c4 \u2022 t) = cycleData t`), and `conjugate_lam0/lam1/laminf`.",
